}

// One key:value line of a breakdown card — label muted-left, value
// bold-right (the Pay-from summary card's row idiom, extracted for the
// compose cost card; Sal's build-17 follow-up 2026-07-18: "use sections
// key: value so it's more clear" instead of one long wrapped string).
component KvRow inherits HorizontalLayout {
